            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>The<a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/products/blue-pure-311i-plus-max\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Blue Pure 311i+ Max</span></a> is the strongest mid-size option for allergy-focused households. Coverage reaches 525 ft² in 12.5 minutes with a CADR of Pollen 446 cfm, Dust 370 cfm, Smoke 339 cfm, across pollen, dust, and smoke. GermShield technology actively protects the filter surface from bacterial growth even when the unit is off, which is valuable in humid environments where mold and bacteria thrive alongside pollen and dust.</p><p>HEPASilent™ filtration removes 99.97% of particles down to 0.1 microns. Upgrading to the<a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/collections/air-purifier-filters\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">AllergenBlock filter</span></a> adds an extra layer of allergen-specific protection against dust, pollen, and pet dander. Auto mode with PM2.5 sensing, app control, voice control via Alexa and Google Assistant, and a 9-month filter life round out the package.</p><h4><strong>Pick #2: Blue Pure 211i Max, Best for Large Allergy-Prone Rooms</strong></h4>",
